1321 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Front of House Manager \055 Clink Hostels \174 2024\023Present\nOptimized end\055to\055end customer journeys across multiple service touchpoints in a high\055volume environment\056 Redesigned operational workflows and implemented experience improvements\054 reducing staff turnover from 132\045 to 50\045\056 Applied data\055informed decision\055making and cross\055functional collaboration to enhance service quality and efficiency\056\n\nAnalyst \055 Smartgaming \174 2023\0232024\nConducted behavioral research and data analysis to understand user engagement and risk patterns in digital environments\056 Translated insights into intervention strategies and experience improvements\056 Applied human\055centered research methods and evidence\055based decision\055making\056\n\nStore Manager \055 Just Brands \174 2022\0232023\nImproved customer experience and operational performance through data\055driven sales and service strategies\056 Analyzed customer behavior and market trends to optimize engagement and outcomes\056 Led team development and service quality initiatives\056\n\nAssistant Manager \055 Hotel Lindrum \174 2019\0232022\nManaged multi\055channel service delivery and improved customer experience across operational touchpoints\056 Optimized cross\055department workflows and implemented service improvements based on customer insights\056 Led teams to improve efficiency and experience quality\056\n\nFront of House \046 Reservation Manager \055 Hotel Lindrum \174 2018\0232019\nManaged service operations and improved customer interactions across front\055of\055house and reservations\056 Resolved complex user issues using human\055centered problem\055solving and supported process improvements\056\n\nOperations Supervisor \046 Accounting \055 Ibis Amsterdam \174 2014\0232018\nImproved operational workflows and service quality through process optimization and quality assurance initiatives\056 Streamlined internal communication and supported data accuracy and operational systems\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 1322 0 R
     /Pg 1315 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
