  << /ActualText (Product Design \055 CareerFoundry \050UX\057UI Specialization\051\nCompleted an intensive product design program focused on UX research\054 interaction design\054 and frontend development\056 Designed end\055to\055end digital experiences from research to high\055fidelity prototypes and usability testing\056\n\nExpert \055  Mentorship Platform \050UX\057UI Product Design\051\nDesigned a responsive platform connecting users with professionals for real\055time guidance\056 Led user research\054 wireframing\054 interaction design\054 and prototyping to improve onboarding and communication flows\056\n\nKubo \055 Digital Identity Vault Concept\nA calm identity vault concept for organizing important documents\073 focused on clarity\054 confidence\054 and peace of mind\056\n\nPortfolio Website \055 Front\055end Development \nDesigned and developed a responsive portfolio website to showcase product design work and case studies\056 Defined information architecture\054 user flows\054 and interaction design\054 and implemented the interface using frontend technologies\056)
